[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=32 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="莫里回来时，身后跟着一个卖鱼的人。两个人都说是对方先答应的，走到你们面前，又一起停住，仿佛谁先开口谁就少了一点理。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="我说的是帮你把鱼送到食堂，不是连篮子也买下来。你刚才可不是这个价。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="鱼贩"

speaker_name=""

text="我哪知道你们食堂在另一条船上。篮子让你拿走，下午我拿什么装鱼？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="那把鱼卸下来，再把篮子送回去？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="听着简单，可她连盖在上面的湿布也算租的。我现在要是把鱼往你怀里一倒，说不定连你的衣服都成她的运输费。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="鱼贩"

speaker_name=""

text="我可没说。你别替我开新价，我还没学会呢。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她们像是吵惯了，话都说得很快。德雷顿从鱼贩手里接过篮子，掀开一角看了看，问里面是不是少了两尾。莫里立刻转头，鱼贩也转头，随后都看向她。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="我只是问问。你们刚才一个说十二，一个说十，不如先数数。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="篮子里有十一尾。鱼贩说一条小的算送，莫里说她听到的是两条小的算送。你把最大的那尾翻开，下面压着一只已经死掉的螃蟹，钳子还夹在篮条上。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="有没有可能，你们把这个也数进去了？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="两个人同时沉默一瞬。鱼贩先笑，莫里把脸转到一边，说自己刚才忙着挑篮子裂的地方，没留意底下。原来一场像要吵完半条街的争论，也可能只多了一只不肯松钳的螃蟹。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="鱼贩"

speaker_name=""

text="行了，篮子留到傍晚。湿布带回来就行，别让你们厨子拿去擦锅。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="那我找两块木条把这个口补了，省得你下次又用裂篮子算人家的账。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="鱼贩"

speaker_name=""

text="可以。钉子别朝里面，扎着鱼你赔。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她们就这样达成了交易，没有握手，也没说刚才误会了。莫里蹲在门边补篮子，你帮她扶木条，发现她的手法很熟，钉歪一颗也不烦，拔出来换个角度再试。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="你们经常这样买东西？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="她爱把价开高，我爱把话说满。各自改不了，一直做下去，倒也知道对方哪句能信。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="那你刚才信她吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="信她的鱼新鲜，不信她“今天最后这点货”。信一件事就够用，不用把整个人一口气包下来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_19"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她把补好的篮子抬起来，放进一块重木板试。裂口没再张开，篮子却歪了一点。她用鞋跟垫住，给你看另一侧旧补丁，说这只篮子已经比原来的木头更像港口地图。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_20"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我以前会不会也做过这种事？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_21"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="你总爱把现在的事往以前扯。刚才你不是找到螃蟹了？这件就算你今天会的，没必要先问祖宗准不准。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_22"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她说完看见你的神情，停了一下，换了个不那么锋利的语气。她说自己也有答应了却没做到的事，拿“以前的我怎样”给现在的自己撑场面，并不总管用。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_23"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="我不认识从前的你，没法替你说那个人好不好。我现在认识一个会扶木条、不会躲开鱼腥味的人，暂时够了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_24"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我其实很想躲。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_25"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="那你刚才也没松手。别把所有想法都跟做过的事算一笔账。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_26"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="食堂的人来取鱼，连那只螃蟹也收走，说能煮汤。莫里立刻问这算不算多送的，厨子让她先去洗手。她走了两步又回来，把篮子租到傍晚的事写到借用板上。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_27"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="你看，跟她吵价的人最后都有张单子，跟她说过的玩笑倒记得格外牢。你以后要借她东西，最好两样都准备。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_28"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你笑着把木屑扫进簸箕。鱼贩在门口喊莫里，问她下次要不要学挑鱼。莫里说不学，学会了以后就不能老说自己被骗；说完还是跑回去，听她指了指鱼鳃。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

